From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arun Iyengar <aiyengar1990@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 18:42:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: build the Orange Pi 5 and 5B DTBs with
 symbols

Overlays for the Orange Pi 5 connectors (MIPI DSI LCDs, MIPI CSI
cameras, USB-C DisplayPort) are applied by the boot loader at boot
time, which needs the __symbols__ node in the base DTB. Kbuild only
adds it to base DTBs that are used by an in-tree overlay application
test.

Pass -@ to dtc for the Orange Pi 5, its M.2 SATA variant and the
Orange Pi 5B, like the Allwinner and MediaTek Makefiles do for boards
with add-on connectors.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile
index 96bcfde1c..178e5b3fb 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile
@@ -1,4 +1,11 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0
+
+# Orange Pi 5/5B: build with symbols so that overlays can be applied by the
+# boot loader
+DTC_FLAGS_rk3588s-orangepi-5 := -@
+DTC_FLAGS_rk3588s-orangepi-5-sata := -@
+DTC_FLAGS_rk3588s-orangepi-5b := -@
+
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ROCKCHIP) += px30-cobra-ltk050h3146w-a2.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ROCKCHIP) += px30-cobra-ltk050h3146w.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_ROCKCHIP) += px30-cobra-ltk050h3148w.dtb
